title: Media and Propaganda
new-page: true
view-if: b_media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: b_media_timer += 4; week_actions += 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
card-image: img/newspapers.jpg
tags: b_party

= Media and Propaganda

What should be our strategy for our newspapers and party organs?

# media strategies: support prov gov, support soviet policies, support Menshevik campaigning, support revolutionary defensism

- @support_socialist_unity
- @oppose_moderates
- @support_ca
- @oppose_ca
- @support_b
- @rural_outreach
- @militancy
- @support_radicalism
- @support_moderation
- @root: We do not need more propaganda.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@support_socialist_unity
title: Support socialist unity.
subtitle: -1 resource – Support a united front of all the socialist parties.
choose-if: b_resources >= 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.b_resources -= 1; 
  Q.sdi_strength += 5; Q.left_m_strength += 5; Q.m_strength += 3; Q.lsr_strength += 5; Q.sr_strength += 3; 
  Q.right_m_strength -= 5; Q.right_sr_strength -= 5; popular_socialist_strength -= 3;
  Q.sdi_relation += 4; Q.left_m_relation += 4; Q.centre_m_relation += 2; Q.lsr_relation += 4; Q.centre_sr_relation += 2;
  Q.right_m_relation += 2; Q.right_sr_relation += 2; Q.ns_relation += 2; 
  Q.moderate_strength += 5; Q.leninist_strength -= 5; 
  Q.moderate_dissent -= 5; Q.leninist_dissent += 5;
!}

We launch a propaganda campaign aimed at supporting a united front of all socialist parties against the counterrevolution. 

This emboldens the left-wings of the various opposition groups, as well as moderates within our own party, while aggravating those opposed to compromise.

@oppose_moderates
title: No more compromises with the petty-bourgeois "socialists"!
subtitle: -1 resource – Distance ourselves from the moderate socialist parties. 
choose-if: b_resources >= 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.b_resources -= 1; 
  Q.sdi_strength -= 4; Q.left_m_strength -= 4; Q.m_strength -= 2; Q.lsr_strength -= 4; Q.sr_strength -= 2; 
  Q.right_m_strength += 4; Q.right_sr_strength += 4; popular_socialist_strength += 4;
  Q.sdi_relation -= 5; Q.left_m_relation -= 5; Q.centre_m_relation -= 5; Q.lsr_relation -= 5; Q.centre_sr_relation -= 5;
  Q.right_m_relation -= 5; Q.right_sr_relation -= 5; Q.ns_relation -= 5; 
  Q.moderate_strength -= 5; Q.leninist_strength += 5; 
  Q.moderate_dissent += 5; Q.leninist_dissent -= 5;
!}

We attack the false promises and hypocrisies of the Mensheviks, SRs, and other moderate socialists. 

This galvanizes support for our party, though hindering relations with all others. The right-wings of the other parties feel emboldened by this. 


@support_ca
title: Support the Constituent Assembly!
subtitle: -1 resource – Promote the coming Constituent Assembly, and our position in it. 
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and ca_held = 0
view-if: ca_held = 0
on-arrival: {!
  Q.b_resources -= 1; 
  Q.ca_support += 1; 
  Q.sdi_strength += 2; Q.left_m_strength += 2; Q.m_strength += 1; Q.lsr_strength += 2; Q.sr_strength += 2; 
  Q.right_m_strength -= 3; Q.right_sr_strength -= 3; popular_socialist_strength -= 2;
  Q.sdi_relation += 2; Q.left_m_relation += 2; Q.centre_m_relation += 1; Q.lsr_relation += 2; Q.centre_sr_relation += 1;
  Q.right_m_relation += 1; Q.right_sr_relation += 1; Q.ns_relation += 1; 
  Q.moderate_strength += 5; Q.leninist_strength -= 5; 
  Q.moderate_dissent -= 5; Q.leninist_dissent += 5;
  Q.workers_b += 1*(1-b_dissent); Q.peasants_b += 1*(1-b_dissent); Q.soldiers_b += 1*(1-b_dissent);
  Q.democraticity += 2; Q.instability -= 1; 
!}

We rally our base to turn-out for the Constituent Assembly.

This emboldens the moderates with our party, and slightly eases fears among other groups. 


@oppose_ca
title: We no longer need the Constituent Assembly!
subtitle: -1 resource – Delegitimize the upcoming Constituent Assembly. 
choose-if: b_resources >= 1 and ca_held = 0 and ca_election_held = 1
view-if: ca_held = 0
on-arrival: {!
  Q.b_resources -= 1; 
  Q.ca_support -= 1; 
  Q.sdi_strength -= 4; Q.left_m_strength -= 4; Q.m_strength -= 2; Q.lsr_strength -= 4; Q.sr_strength -= 2; 
  Q.right_m_strength += 4; Q.right_sr_strength += 4; popular_socialist_strength += 4;
  Q.sdi_relation -= 5; Q.left_m_relation -= 5; Q.centre_m_relation -= 5; Q.lsr_relation -= 5; Q.centre_sr_relation -= 5;
  Q.right_m_relation -= 5; Q.right_sr_relation -= 5; Q.ns_relation -= 5; 
  Q.moderate_strength -= 5; Q.leninist_strength += 5; 
  Q.moderate_dissent += 5; Q.leninist_dissent -= 5;
  Q.democraticity -= 2; Q.instability += 1; 
!}

We publicize the problems with the upcoming Constituent Assembly, and build support for its replacement. 

This alarms the other parties, as well as moderates within our own party. 


@support_b
title: Build support for the Bolsheviks among the urban workers. 
subtitle: -1 resource
choose-if: b_resources >= 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.b_resources -= 1;
  Q.b_strength += 2; Q.leninist_strength += 1;
  Q.disillusionment -= 0.1; Q.instability -= 1;
  Q.workers_b += 3*(1-b_dissent);
  Q.soldiers_b += 3*(1-b_dissent);
!}

Our propaganda campaign encourages support for the Bolshevik party among the workers and in the garrisons. 

@rural_outreach
title: Perform outreach to the countryside. 
subtitle: -1 resource - Build stronger relations with the peasants. 
choose-if: b_resources >= 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.b_resources -= 1;
  Q.b_strength += 2; Q.leninist_strength += 1;
  Q.disillusionment -= 0.1; Q.instability -= 1;
  Q.peasants_b += 3*(1-b_dissent); Q.peasants_unrest -= 4;
  Q.kulaks_b += 3*(1-b_dissent); Q.kulaks_unrest -= 4;
  Q.ca_support -= 1; 
!}

Our propaganda campaign encourages support for the Bolshevik party among the peasants. 


@militancy
title: Support militancy and vigilance against counterrevolution. 
subtitle: -1 resource - Promote military recruitment and labor intensity.   
choose-if: b_resources >= 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.b_resources -= 1;
  Q.b_strength += 1; Q.leninist_strength += 1;
  Q.disillusionment -= 0.05; Q.instability += 1;
  Q.militancy += 8; Q.crime -= 3; Q.war_weariness -= 2; Q.morale += 0.02; Q.discipline += 0.04;
  Q.soldiers_unrest -= 6; Q.workers_unrest -= 3; Q.peasants_unrest -= 3;
!}

We push for increased militarization and strength in the face of ongoing crises. 


@support_radicalism
title: Support revolution and radicalism.
subtitle: -1 resource - Encourage class conflict, land seizures, and the power of the proletariat. 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if b_resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?]
choose-if: b_resources >= 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.b_resources -= 1; 
  Q.soldiers_unrest -= 5; Q.workers_unrest -= 8; Q.peasants_unrest -= 8; Q.kulaks_unrest -= 8; 
  Q.soldiers_strength += 2; Q.workers_strength += 4; Q.peasants_strength += 6; Q.kulaks_strength += 6; 
  Q.elites_unrest += 6; Q.middle_unrest += 2; Q.intelligentsia_unrest += 4; 
  Q.workers_b += 2*(1-b_dissent); Q.peasants_b += 2*(1-b_dissent); Q.workers_b += 2*(1-b_dissent); 
  Q.instability += 2; Q.militancy += 4; Q.crime += 4; Q.morale -= 0.04; Q.discipline -= 0.04; Q.train_capacity *= 0.95; 
  Q.Q.food_production *= 0.95; Q.food_sold *= 0.99; 
  Q.Q.industries_syndicalized += 5; Q.industry *= 0.95; 
  Q.moderate_dissent += 4; Q.leninist_dissent -= 2; Q.leftcom_dissent -= 4;
  Q.moderate_strength -= 2; Q.leninist_strength += 2; Q.leftcom_strength += 4;
  Q.anarchist_strength += 2; Q.maximalist_strength += 2;
  Q.anarchist_relation += 5; Q.maximalist_relation += 5;
!}

We enflame the ongoing conflicts in the cities and countryside, rallying the working masses to our side, though possibly at the expense of state functions. 

@support_moderation
title: Support moderation and consolidation. 
subtitle: -1 resource - Encourage stricter discipline, authority, and a return to normality. 
unavailable-subtitle: [? if b_resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?]
choose-if: b_resources >= 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.b_resources -= 1; 
  Q.soldiers_unrest += 2; Q.workers_unrest += 4; Q.peasants_unrest += 4; Q.kulaks_unrest += 8;
  Q.soldiers_strength -= 1; Q.workers_strength -= 2; Q.peasants_strength -= 2; Q.kulaks_strength -= 2; 
  Q.elites_unrest -= 2; Q.middle_unrest -= 5; Q.intelligentsia_unrest -= 5;
  Q.instability -= 2; Q.militancy -= 5; Q.crime -= 2; Q.morale += 0.02; Q.discipline += 0.04; 
  Q.industry *= 1.02;
  Q.moderate_dissent -= 2; Q.leftcom_dissent += 6;
  Q.anarchist_strength -= 1; Q.maximalist_strength -= 1;
  Q.anarchist_relation -= 5; Q.maximalist_relation -= 5;
!}

We promote stricter compliance and consolidation, seeking to put an end to the chaos. 

Though some complain that we are dampening the revolutionary fervor of the masses, hopefully this will right the economic situation in the country. 
